  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "After all that's transpired, you have little chance of finding support for your alliance. There's basically no hope for peace at this point.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Shamiss_MIR_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1389041,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC07-C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "He's right. I warned Freeder, but he wouldn't listen. When he came to tell Chairman Meow of his plan, the Sayameez Hardliners went ballistic!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_SorcererF_G_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Miriam_MIR_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1401004,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC06-C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Pardon me. Sorry to butt in, but I believe there is yet hope. The Chairman was open to possibility. It was Goofang who ruined everything.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Sorcerer_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PrefectJosapat_MIR_16.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1401006,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC06-C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Goofang and the Sayameez Hardliners took the Chairman and the Vice-Chair hostage. They're being held in Goofang's Laboratory.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Sorcerer_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PrefectJosapat_MIR_17.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1401006,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC06-C_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I suspect, Wizard, that if you have this artifact and you were to liberate the Chairman, we still might be able to forge a compromise.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Sorcerer_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PrefectJosapat_MIR_18.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1401006,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Then we'll go to the Laboratory straight away. We're not giving up. C'mon, Master. Goofang has no idea who he's messing with.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Djinn_MageF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Istar_MIR_115.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1389038,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-YAKH-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I have my doubts about whether this exercise is worth it, but if you are successful, you will still have my support, as promised.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Shamiss_MIR_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1389041,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
